cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: excgrid
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Makowski
    given-names: Marcin
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/myamlak/excgrid"
abstract: >-
  A standalone grid + exchange-correlation kernel + D3-dispersion library:
  molecular block-grid construction (Murray-Handy-Laming radial,
  Lebedev-Laikov angular, Becke/SSF partition) and Yacas-code-generated
  LDA/GGA/hybrid energy-density kernels with first derivatives.
